1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,193
ALARM. COMMUTE. 40 HOURS.

2
00:00:02,193 --> 00:00:02,734
PAYDAY...

3
00:00:02,734 --> 00:00:04,439
and a week later, it's GONE.

4
00:00:04,559 --> 00:00:06,500
So is the 9-to-5 a TRAP?

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,223
In 1886,

6
00:00:10,223 --> 00:00:12,473
hundreds of thousands of workers

7
00:00:12,473 --> 00:00:13,907
STRUCK for an 8-HOUR DAY.

8
00:00:14,027 --> 00:00:16,407
By 1940, federal law

9
00:00:16,407 --> 00:00:18,123
made 40 HOURS the standard week.

10
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,913
Over 35 years,

11
00:00:21,913 --> 00:00:25,114
typical pay rose just 8% after INFLATION.

12
00:00:25,234 --> 00:00:27,117
Today, nearly HALF of renters

13
00:00:27,117 --> 00:00:29,821
spend over 30% of income on HOUSING.

14
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,790
37% couldn't cover

15
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:35,359
a $400 SURPRISE with cash.

16
00:00:35,479 --> 00:00:36,658
So many BORROW,

17
00:00:36,658 --> 00:00:38,679
at about 21% INTEREST.

18
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,549
Build FREEDOM slowly:

19
00:00:41,549 --> 00:00:44,111
EMERGENCY FUND first, then INVEST.

20
00:00:44,231 --> 00:00:47,803
$200 a month at 7%, for 30 years,

21
00:00:47,803 --> 00:00:50,205
is about $244,000.

22
00:00:50,505 --> 00:00:51,955
A STEADY JOB helps.

23
00:00:52,075 --> 00:00:54,891
The 9-to-5 isn't necessarily the TRAP.

24
00:00:55,011 --> 00:00:56,927
It's working your ENTIRE LIFE

25
00:00:56,927 --> 00:00:58,915
without building FINANCIAL FREEDOM.

